      "kind": "action",
      "title": "C: Create item with empty name",
      "detail": "Authenticated POST /items with body {\"name\":\"\"}. The contract says an empty or absent name returns 422, and server.py returns 422 with {\"error\":\"name is required\"}. The 422 is the documented expected result.",
      "actor": "user",
      "app": "service",
      "api": "{\"method\":\"POST\",\"path\":\"/items\",\"headers\":[{\"name\":\"Content-Type\",\"value\":\"application/json\"},{\"name\":\"Authorization\",\"value\":\"Bearer {{token}}\"}],\"body\":\"{\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\"}\",\"statuses\":[422],\"assertions\":[],\"captures\":[],\"timeoutSeconds\":20}",
